1 - Install VSCode
2 - install and open msys2:
    a. pacman -Syu
    b. open desired msys version (recomended UCRT64)
    c. pacman -Su
    d. pacman -S mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-toolchain mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-nodejs mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-python mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-gdb mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-cmake
    e. install other desired libs - (git, make, etc)
3 - Add msys2 folders to path
    a. ...C:\Dev\apps\msys64\usr\bin
    b. ...C:\Dev\apps\msys64\usr\include
    c. ...C:\Dev\apps\msys64\ucrt64\bin
    d. ...C:\Dev\apps\msys64\ucrt64\lib
    e. ...C:\Dev\apps\msys64\ucrt64\include
4 - Install VSCode extensions


usefull libs:
    mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-sfml
    mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-SDL2
    mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-SDL2_image
